@redbtn:registry=https://registry.redbtn.io/
# No credential is committed here. Auth is supplied at use time:
#   - Docker build: BuildKit secret mount (--mount=type=secret,id=npmrc),
#     backed by the global NPMRC redsecret that RedRun injects into every
#     git-source build.
#   - CI: written from the REDBTN_NPM_USER / REDBTN_NPM_PASSWORD Actions
#     secrets by .github/workflows/ci.yml, then removed after install.
#   - Local dev: your own ~/.npmrc.
